  "proved": [
    "Rational term evaluation depends only on variables occurring in the supplied terms.",
    "Every noninitial class has a selected original WDVV request with nonzero exact leading coefficient and strictly lower positive-class point dependencies.",
    "The initial sector consists of all classes of energy at most two and the line seed; exhaustive full-coordinate enumeration proves no class is omitted.",
