    "The initial table is derived using only the existing genus-zero line/exceptional seeds, prior WDVV ruling/L deductions, the new four WDVV checks and the auxiliary zero-point convention.",
    "pointValue terminates by energy and is uniquely determined by its initial values and original decreasing equations.",
    "pointValue_eq_eval discharges those equation hypotheses from the original checked relation and existing named geometric laws; no recurrence is assumed.",
    "primaryValue_eq_eval covers arbitrary primary basis multisets through the existing degree-zero, string, divisor and dimension reductions.",
    "pointTable preserves full curve coordinates and agrees with pointValue for every class within every energy bound; strict decrease ensures every lower lookup is present.",
    "Both cached interfaces agree with the original computations and have the same geometric soundness contracts.",
    "Kernel replay computes the plane cubic value twelve and proves the corresponding eight-point GW invariant under the stated geometric inputs and plane line seed."
